The task to add the costs of the hockey and soccer tickets together can be defined as "AddCosts". This task will take the results from "BuyHockeyTickets" and "BuySoccerTickets" and sum them up. Here's how it could be added to the TG:

```json
{
    "owner_agent": "CalcDifEq",
    "tasks": {
        "BuyHockeyTickets": "Calculate the cost of buying 7 hockey tickets.",
        "BuySoccerTickets": "Calculate the cost of buying 2 soccer tickets.",
        "AddCosts": "Add the costs from BuyHockeyTickets and BuySoccerTickets."
    },
    "orders": [
        {
            "condition": "success",
            "from": "BuySoccerTickets",
            "to": "AddCosts"
        },
        {
            "condition": "success",
            "from": "BuyHockeyTickets",
            "to": "AddCosts"
        }
    ],
    "refused": false,
    "answer": null
}
```
